Relations
Relation	Module	Parent	Description
instances	relational model		each instance of a JSON text, molten: the instance that holds it, the JSON Pointer from it, its type and its text
runs	relational model	instances	each run of text of a string that holds FF, a line break or HT: its page, line and position, and its text
file	relational model		each file a call reads, by its position, and its pathname
sheets	relational model	file	each sheet chosen: its records, the records a filter keeps, and the positions of those named
origins	relational model	file	each sheet given to a selection, by its position, and the file it is of
positions	positions		each position a selection names, in the order named
Domains
Relation	Column	Domain	Key	References	Type	Description
instances	_instance		primary		number	the instance's zero-based position among the instances of its text, the value itself first, in the order written
instances	_parent	_instance		instances	number	the instance that holds this one, empty for the value itself
instances	_pointer				text	the JSON Pointer to the instance from the instance that holds it, empty for the value itself
instances	_type				JSON type	the instance's primitive type
instances	_value				text	the instance's text: a string's characters, a number as written, true or false; empty for null, an object, an array, and a string held as runs
runs	_instance		primary	instances	number	the string
runs	_page		primary		number	the zero-based count of FF before the run of text
runs	_line		primary		number	the zero-based count of line breaks before the run within its page
runs	_position		primary		number	the zero-based count of HT before the run within its line
runs	_value				text	the run of text
file	file		primary		number	the file's position in the call, from 1
file	source				absolute path	the file's resolved pathname, or the name of the data bank's input it is
sheets	file		primary	file	number	the file
sheets	sheet		primary		number	the sheet's position in its file, from 1
sheets	sheet name				text	the sheet's name
sheets	records				number	the records the sheet holds
sheets	matches				number	the records the filter keeps
sheets	positions				text	the positions of the records named, as a selection writes them
origins	sheet		primary		number	the sheet's position among the sheets given, from 1
origins	file			file	number	the file the sheet is of
positions	position		primary		number	a position, counted from 1
